    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take off on a wild, chaotic adventure in <i>Narco Express</i> \u2013 the ultimate co-op smuggling simulator set in the skies over Mexico! </strong><br><br>Join forces with friends or fly solo as you take on the role of low-budget drug mules trying to survive in a ridiculous and dangerous world of airborne crime. Fly janky planes held together with duct tape, dodge the military, upgrade your gear, and smuggle \u201ccargo\u201d across absurdly risky routes \u2013 all while trying not to crash.  <br>  <br>  <br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op smuggling action for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly and upgrade your own shady aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge patrols, survive Weather, and make risky landings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock costumes, gear, and better airplanes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic, physics-driven flight gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of absurd missions, sketchy characters, and hilarious failure  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Get ready to fly dirty and crash often Welcome to <i>Narco Express</i>!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take off on a wild, chaotic adventure in <i>Narco Express</i> \u2013 the ultimate co-op smuggling simulator set in the skies over Mexico! </strong><br><br>Join forces with friends or fly solo as you take on the role of low-budget drug mules trying to survive in a ridiculous and dangerous world of airborne crime. Fly janky planes held together with duct tape, dodge the military, upgrade your gear, and smuggle \u201ccargo\u201d across absurdly risky routes \u2013 all while trying not to crash.  <br>  <br>  <br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op smuggling action for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly and upgrade your own shady aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge patrols, survive Weather, and make risky landings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock costumes, gear, and better airplanes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic, physics-driven flight gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of absurd missions, sketchy characters, and hilarious failure  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>Get ready to fly dirty and crash often Welcome to <i>Narco Express</i>!</strong></p>",
